<title>UK: Schleswig-Holstein Hypo adds 100 mln marks to bond.</title>
<headline>Schleswig-Holstein Hypo adds 100 mln marks to bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following has been increased to 400 million  marks from 300 million marks lead manager Commerzbank said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SCHLESWIG-HOLSTEINISCHE LANDSCHAFT HYPOTHEKENBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT  **400 MLN DEM   COUPON    *5.50	MATURITY    16.JUL.07</p>
<p> TYPE   REX-LINKED    ISS PRICE  99.45     PAY DATE    08.AUG.97</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) ONE	 LISTING    HAMBURG   GOV LAW     GERMAN</p>
<p> NOTES	*FOR FIRST YEAR THEN 80 PCT OF THE REX 10-YEAR</p>
<p>		 YIELD SUBINDEX.</p>
<p>	     **LAUNCHED ORIGINALLY FOR 300 MILLION MARKS ON</p>
<p>04.JUL.97</p>
<p>		 OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF 642.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
